## Monitoring

### Execution Tracking

- Review execution history regularly: identify failing workflows and error patterns.
- Set up alerts for workflow failures: Error Trigger node sends notification on any failure.
- Track execution duration: identify long-running workflows that may need optimization.

### Error Patterns

| Pattern | Action |
|---|---|
| Repeated timeout on external API | Check API health, increase timeout, add retry logic |
| Authentication failures | Verify credential validity, check for rotation needed |
| Payload validation errors | Review incoming data format, update validation logic |
| Rate limit exceeded | Add delays between API calls, implement request queuing |
| Memory/queue issues | Monitor instance resources, scale or split workflows |

### Alerting

- Configure an Error Workflow that triggers on any workflow failure.
- Notifications should include: workflow name, error message, execution ID, timestamp.
- Route critical alerts to immediate channels (Slack), non-critical to async channels (email<% if (integrations.asana) { %>, Asana<% } %>).

---

## Integration Patterns

### Error Handling Strategy

| Strategy | When to Use |
|---|---|
| **Retry (transient)** | Network errors, timeouts, 5xx responses. Retry 3 times with exponential backoff. |
| **Dead-letter** | Persistent failures after retries. Route to a dead-letter queue/workflow for manual review. |
| **Alert on repeated errors** | Same error 3+ times in 1 hour. Escalate to the responsible team. |
| **Circuit breaker** | External service consistently failing. Disable calls temporarily, alert, retry after cooldown. |

### Credential Rotation

- Schedule credential rotation for all external service API keys.
- After rotation: update credential in n8n store, trigger a test execution, verify success.
- Document rotation schedule and responsible party for each credential.

### Rate Limiting

- Respect external API rate limits -- read documentation before integrating.
- Implement delays between sequential API calls using Wait nodes.
- For bulk operations, use batching with appropriate intervals.
- Monitor 429 responses and adjust timing dynamically.

### Data Validation

- Validate inputs at workflow entry points (webhook, trigger).
- Validate outputs before sending to external systems.
- Use IF nodes or Switch nodes to route invalid data to error handling.
- Log validation failures for debugging.

